<title>PORTUGAL: Competition council clears Tabaqueira bids.</title>
<headline>Competition council clears Tabaqueira bids.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Competition Council scrutinising the privatisation of a 65 percent stake in Portuguese tobacco company Tabaqueira has decided that all three bidding groups complied with competition rules, an official source said.</p>
<p>&quot;In no circumstances were there any objections to any of the bids,&quot; the source told Reuters.</p>
</text>
